@SpawnBlur ActorId:Ema Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0.3
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:プレゼント……？|#0103Adv28_Ema002| AuthorId:Ema RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HidePrinter
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:30 IdAndAppearance:Hanna.Surprised1
@SpawnBlur ActorId:Ema Intensity:0.1 FadeDuration:0.3
@SpawnBlur ActorId:Hanna Intensity:0 FadeDuration:0.3
@Wait WaitMode:0.3

[PrintTextModified Text:騒がなくってもよろしくてよ！？<br>ぜんぜん大したものじゃありませんから！|#0103Adv28_Hanna003| AuthorId:Hanna RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

